# Section Components

- Use `assetUrl()` for images from `/public`, never hardcode paths
- Mobile-first responsive: lighter overlays on mobile so photos are visible
- Section spacing: `py-28 md:py-36`, container: `px-6 lg:px-12`
- Section label pattern: `section-line` + gold uppercase text with `tracking-[0.25em]`
- Titles: `font-serif font-light`, body: `font-sans font-light`
- Text on dark backgrounds: use `text-foreground/50` to `text-foreground/70`, not pure white
- All data from `useData()` hook, never hardcoded content
